@startuml subtitles-state-machine
title Subtitles track lifecycle (UI + asset + edit-validation)

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Hidden

Hidden : track not mounted
Hidden : (flag off OR draft not reel/story)
Hidden --> Empty : flag on && video-capable draft && no subtitles asset
Hidden --> Ready : flag on && video-capable draft && existing subtitles asset

state Empty {
  Empty : no cues, no asset
  Empty : "Générer les sous-titres" CTA
  Empty : style = DEFAULT_BURN_IN_STYLE
}

Empty --> Generating : click "Générer"\n[draftId present]

state Generating {
  Generating : POST generate-subtitles in flight
  Generating : controls disabled, estimator bar
  Generating : mock/default = PURE, no network, cost 0
}

Generating --> Editing : 200, cues.length > 0\n(auto-persisted -> asset exists)
Generating --> Empty : 200, cues.length == 0\n(empty script, nothing persisted, hint shown)
Generating --> Error : 4xx/5xx\n(409 format, 409 refine no-key, 502 refine 5xx, 400, 429)

state Editing {
  Editing : CueEditor populated
  Editing : live validateCues on every change
  Editing : SubtitleStyleControls + SubtitleOverlayPreview
  --
  state "valid (editing)" as EVALID
  state "invalid" as EINVALID
  [*] --> EVALID
  EVALID --> EINVALID : edit introduces an error\n(overlap/order/line-length/lines/empty)
  EINVALID --> EVALID : fix all errors
  EINVALID : "Enregistrer" disabled\nerror summary + highlighted rows
  EVALID : "Enregistrer" enabled when dirty\nwarnings (CPS/short/gap) non-blocking
}

Editing --> Saving : click "Enregistrer"\n[valid && dirty]
Editing --> Generating : click "Régénérer"\n(confirm overwrite)

state Saving {
  Saving : PUT subtitles in flight
  Saving : server re-validates (authoritative)
}

Saving --> Ready : 200 { media }\n(asset replaced, role='subtitles' meta.srt/meta.style)
Saving --> Editing : 400 cueErrors\n(server validation mapped onto rows)
Saving --> Error : 401/403/404/409/5xx

state Ready {
  Ready : asset matches editor (clean)
  Ready : "Régénérer" + "Enregistrer" (disabled, nothing to save)
}

Ready --> Editing : edit a cue / change style (dirty)
Ready --> Generating : click "Régénérer" (confirm overwrite)
Empty --> Saving : (rare) add cues manually then Enregistrer
Editing --> Empty : delete all cues -> cues == [] then Enregistrer clears asset (E9)

Error --> Generating : click "Réessayer"
Error --> Editing : (asset/cues still in editor) fix & retry save

note right of Generating
  refine=false (default) : parseScriptToCues + serializeSrt
                           PURE, NO network, cost 0
  refine=true + live+key : 1 LLM call tidies TEXT only
  refine=true + live+no-key : -> Error (409), never Generating success
  refine=true + mock : ignored (no provider call)
end note

note bottom of Ready
  Ready asset participates in:
   - Compose (../02_compose) reads meta.srt (state.subtitles) + meta.style (burn-in)
   - Publish confirm track summary (D4): 💬 Sous-titres ✓
end note

Ready --> [*] : draft published / discarded
@enduml
